os, autenticación y respuesta multipart de Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-71/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference",{"_71":291},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx",{"_46":293,"_53":64,"_48":294,"_58":295,"_67":-7,"_12":296,"_69":297},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","Diagnóstico de enrolamiento","Localiza fallos de transporte, autenticación, registro, emisión e instalación.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-71/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting",{"_71":298},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment",{"_202":301},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg>",{"_46":304,"_53":64,"_48":241,"_58":305,"_67":-7,"_12":306,"_69":307},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview.mdx","Elige la política de admisión y conecta DMS, confianza inicial y cliente EST.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-71/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview",{"_71":308},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview.mdx",{"_53":54,"_48":310,"_55":-7,"_57":-7,"_58":-7,"_60":-7,"_50":311,"_46":319,"_69":320,"_67":322},"Integraciones",[312],{"_46":313,"_53":64,"_48":314,"_58":315,"_67":-7,"_12":316,"_69":317},"es:platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core.mdx","AWS IoT Core","El conector de Lamassu para AWS IoT Core sincroniza las identidades de los dispositivos con la plataforma AWS, gestionando el registro de CAs, el aprovisionamiento de Things y el ciclo de vida de los certif